+static w906dlg::AlarmSlot g_alarmSlot;  static std::string g_w906NoticeGatePassed;   //AI(W906-NOTICE-DEFER-4) 20261007: + the id of a notifyAck whose auth gate MbWait already ran (the main-loop arm then skips it -- the gate spends the one-shot pass).  AI(W906-J5-ACK) 20260930: what the Alarm-dialog-request mailbox holds now (tools/wb_dialog_mailbox.h AlarmSlot: idle / notice / blocking) -- written only by DialogMailboxPostAlarm / DialogMailboxRetire (through w906dlg::AlarmPost / AlarmRetire), read by W906_NoticeAckCommand (EOF).  Tick thread only.  On the old blank line, so no line below moves
